    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d424">

                <pb facs="0509" n="343" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg343"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/231b</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Leavell
                    </hi><anchor n="5" xml:id="d424-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-09-21T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 21, 1911—5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s February 9, 3 p.m. Inform Government to which you are accredited
                    that the United States desires it clearly understood that she has not recognized
                    Tinoco’s Government in Costa Rica and would not regard his recognition by
                    Government to which you are accredited as evidence of a friendly feeling toward
                    the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d424-f1" n="5" type="source" xml:id="d424-f1-content">
                <p>Same to the American Legations at Tegucigalpa, Managua, San Salvador.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
